      <MissionDesc>THE CALIFORNIA HEALTH CARE COALITION IS A MEMBERSHIP ORGANIZATION OF PRIVATE AND PUBLIC SECTOR EMPLOYERS, UNIONS, AND HEALTH &amp; WELFARE TRUST FUNDS DETERMINED TO IMPROVE HEALTHCARE QUALITY, SAVE LIVES, AND CONTROL COSTS WITHOUT LOSING BENEFITS.</MissionDesc>
